+# P2-R local Windows preparation and execution status, 19 November 2026
+
+The operator requested execution on the current Windows computer. This request
+is recorded separately from the supervisor reply and departmental allocation
+required by the reviewed department protocol. The local machine has not acquired
+formal device qualification. No local output is automatically a replacement for
+any published or archived result.
+
+The source runner is frozen at Git b6d44d5742eb98008f40df57ce1aba2ad1f623a2.
+The Linux build uses .NET SDK 10.0.403. The WSL offline preflight passed with
+Node v22.23.5 and the canonical worklist digest. Both Rqc and Substrate built
+without warnings or errors. These are deployment observations, not evidence of
+model determinism or scientific agreement.
+
+A local collector development change permits exact, explicitly pinned historical
+retention witnesses predating the current boot. The current-host checks for all
+window events remain active. The change requires independent configuration review
+before use in a departmental phase. Private native XML and host identifiers remain
+in the local receipt directory, outside this document.
+
+The local run record must preserve the actual server version, model digests,
+individual fresh launches, model-unload evidence, pre/post host logs, repeat audit,
+positive controls, full regeneration comparisons, interruptions and all deviations.
+Regeneration must stop when repeat/control checks or log coverage fail. Device
+qualification, supervisor authorization and manuscript adoption remain separate.
+
+## Draft manuscript wording pending local execution
+
+English: A Windows-hosted WSL 2 environment was prepared and its offline dependency
+checks passed. Local execution was initiated under the operator's instruction on a
+machine without established device qualification. These engineering observations
+do not establish reproducibility of the archived model outputs. Scientific
+comparisons and any replacement of the archived results require complete run
+records and review of the recorded deviations.
+
+中文：已完成 Windows 宿主与 WSL 2 运行环境部署，离线依赖预检通过。本机运行依据操作者指令启动，但设备尚未取得正式资格。环境部署及工程运行不能证明归档模型输出可重复；科学比较及归档结果替换须依据完整运行记录，并审阅环境和执行方案的偏离。
+
+This wording is a draft addendum. The private Chinese/English manuscripts and
+thesis source are not present in this checkout; no PDF rebuild or insertion into
+the authoritative manuscripts is claimed. Human source verification and author
+approval remain pending.
